{"id":"b3730ef38d81f273","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-set-relativization-semantics.md","title":"相对化的子结构语义","display":"thm-set-relativization-semantics — 相对化的子结构语义","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-set-relativization-semantics","aliases":["72-thm-set-relativization-semantics"],"display":"thm-set-relativization-semantics — 相对化的子结构语义","depends_on":["[[72-df-set-formula-relativization]]"],"chapter":"IV","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IV §1.2 relative formulas, print216/PDF228; local structural proof","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local argument checked; not machine checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-set-relativization-semantics"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-set-relativization-semantics</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-set-relativization-semantics — 相对化的子结构语义"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"89b10fd8e1240dc5\" href=\"?note=89b10fd8e1240dc5\" title=\"72-df-set-formula-relativization\">72-df-set-formula-relativization</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"IV"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV §1.2 relative formulas, print216/PDF228; local structural proof"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local argument checked; not machine checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\ne M\\subseteq N\">\\(\\varnothing\\ne M\\subseteq N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in N\">\\(M\\in N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal F_\\in\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal F_\\in\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\notin\\operatorname{av}_s(A)\">\\(z\\notin\\operatorname{av}_s(A)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\\in N^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}\">\\(\\eta\\in N^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\\in M^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}\">\\(\\gamma\\in M^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta(z)=M\">\\(\\eta(z)=M\\)</span> 且在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)\\)</span> 上相同；语义取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"89b10fd8e1240dc5\" href=\"?note=89b10fd8e1240dc5\" title=\"72-df-set-formula-relativization\">72-df-set-formula-relativization</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"N,\\eta\\models_s A^{[z]}\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad M,\\gamma\\models_s A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[N,\\eta\\models_s A^{[z]}\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad M,\\gamma\\models_s A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原子在两个结构上都是相同对象之间的真实身份和成员关系；布尔分支保持。相对化量词在 N 中恰遍历 M 的成员，更新同一变量后使用归纳假设即可。M∈N 使 η(z)=M 合法，M⊆N 使受限量词遍历的每个对象也属于 N。此结论不需要 M 或 N 传递；传递性是下一条 Δ₀ 绝对性所用的另一个条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-set-formula-relativization","status":"resolved","id":"89b10fd8e1240dc5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-set-formula-relativization]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-set-formula-relativization","status":"resolved","id":"89b10fd8e1240dc5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varnothing\\ne M\\subseteq N$ 且 $M\\in N$，$A\\in\\mathcal F_\\in$，$z\\notin\\operatorname{av}_s(A)$。$\\eta\\in N^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}$、$\\gamma\\in M^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}$ 满足 $\\eta(z)=M$ 且在 $\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)$ 上相同；语义取 [[72-df-set-formula-relativization]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\varnothing\\ne M\\subseteq N","display":false},{"tex":"M\\in N","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal F_\\in","display":false},{"tex":"z\\notin\\operatorname{av}_s(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta\\in N^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma\\in M^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta(z)=M","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"N,\\eta\\models_s A^{[z]}\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad M,\\gamma\\models_s A.","display":true}],"bytes":1604,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-145","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IV章新增10项：[[72-df-admissible-ordinal-set-theory]] · [[72-df-constructible-consequence-norm]] · [[72-df-constructible-hierarchy]] · [[72-df-kripke-platek-theories]] · [[72-df-set-formula-relativization]] · [[72-df-set-theory-syntax]] · [[72-thm-constructible-transitivity]] · [[72-thm-delta-zero-set-absoluteness]] · [[72-thm-omega-admissible]] · [[72-thm-set-relativization-semantics]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-142","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IV章新增10项：[[72-df-admissible-ordinal-set-theory]] · [[72-df-constructible-consequence-norm]] · [[72-df-constructible-hierarchy]] · [[72-df-kripke-platek-theories]] · [[72-df-set-formula-relativization]] · [[72-df-set-theory-syntax]] · [[72-thm-constructible-transitivity]] · [[72-thm-delta-zero-set-absoluteness]] · [[72-thm-omega-admissible]] · [[72-thm-set-relativization-semantics]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-515","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IV章新增10项：[[72-df-admissible-ordinal-set-theory]] · [[72-df-constructible-consequence-norm]] · [[72-df-constructible-hierarchy]] · [[72-df-kripke-platek-theories]] · [[72-df-set-formula-relativization]] · [[72-df-set-theory-syntax]] · [[72-thm-constructible-transitivity]] · [[72-thm-delta-zero-set-absoluteness]] · [[72-thm-omega-admissible]] · [[72-thm-set-relativization-semantics]]"}],"outgoing":["89b10fd8e1240dc5"]}